```mermaid
graph TD
    %% Architecture Diagram
    subgraph Frontend [Frontend SPA]
        React[React 18]
        Zustand[Zustand State]
        Tailwind[Tailwind CSS v4 + Shadcn UI]
        Echo[Laravel Echo & Pusher JS]
        React --> Zustand
        React --> Tailwind
        React --> Echo
    end

    subgraph Integration
        Inertia[Inertia.js Server-Driven State]
    end

    subgraph Backend [Laravel Modular Monolith]
        Laravel[Laravel 12 API & Controllers]
        Services[app/Services - Business Logic]
        Reverb[Laravel Reverb - WebSockets]
        
        subgraph Modules [nwidart/laravel-modules]
            Core[Core Module]
            ERP[ERP Module]
            CRM[CRM Module]
            Billing[Billing Module]
            Booking[Booking Module]
            Marketplace[Marketplace Module]
            Fbmb[Fbmb Module]
            Freelance[Freelance Module]
        end

        Laravel --> Services
        Laravel --> Modules
        Laravel --> Reverb
    end

    subgraph External & Key Services [Third Party / Packages]
        S3[(AWS S3 / Flysystem)]
        FCM[FCM Notification Channels]
        Dompdf[barryvdh/laravel-dompdf]
    end

    subgraph Data Layer
        Eloquent[Eloquent ORM]
        DB[(MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQLite)]
        Redis[(Redis Cache/Queue)]
        Meili[(Meilisearch via Scout)]
    end

    Frontend <-->|JSON/XHR| Inertia
    Inertia <--> Laravel
    Echo <-->|WebSockets| Reverb
    Services --> Eloquent
    Modules --> Eloquent
    Eloquent --> DB
    Laravel --> Redis
    Laravel --> Meili
    Laravel --> S3
    Laravel --> FCM
    Laravel --> Dompdf
```
